# ars.R
# Adaptive Rejection Sampling for univariate log-concave densities
#
# Reference:
#   Gilks, W. R., & Wild, P. (1992). "Adaptive rejection sampling for
#   Gibbs sampling." Journal of the Royal Statistical Society: Series C
#   (Applied Statistics), 41(2), 337-348.
#
# The implementation is modular.  The main user-facing function is
